All 15 tests now pass. Here's what was fixed in `src/`:

**`src/auth.py`**
- `has_permission`: made role comparison case-insensitive by lowercasing both sides.
- `is_admin_or_owner`: changed `and` to `or` so that being either an admin *or* the owner grants access.

**`src/inventory.py`**
- `__init__`: replaced mutable default argument `{}` with `None` + a fresh dict copy to prevent shared state across instances.
- `add`: changed from overwriting stock to accumulating (`self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty`).
- `reserve`: changed `qty >= self.available(sku)` to `qty > self.available(sku)` so reserving exactly the available amount is allowed.
- `release`: added a guard to raise `ValueError` when releasing more than the currently reserved quantity.

**`src/text_utils.py`**
- `slugify`: lowercased alphanumeric characters and replaced the single `"--"` → `"-"` replacement with a `while` loop to fully collapse repeated separators.
- `truncate`: made the suffix count against `max_len` by slicing to `max_len - len(suffix)` instead of `max_len`.
